I've made a new version, the main difference is that now I strip those
$_{}, making x1 of $x_{1}$. The difference is in the dictionary
actually, and I've included my dictionary maker (which uses
jbovlastefile obtained from http://jbovlaste.lojban.org/export/xml.html).
I've also fixed the unicode bug. Pages with embedded javascript still
won't work.
So, here is the source: http://students.mimuw.edu.pl/~js/titles.tar.gz
And here is updated demo: http://students.mimuw.edu.pl/~js/lpp/lpp.html
When I said "It would be nice if it looked more like hover tips in
jbovlaste" I've obviously meant vlasisku.

